-- title:
--   Power-series presentation from generators of the relative cotangent space
-- statement:
--   Let $\mathcal{O}$ be a commutative local ring which is adically complete with respect to its maximal ideal $\mathfrak{m}_{\mathcal{O}}$, and let $R$ be a commutative noetherian local $\mathcal{O}$-algebra which is adically complete with respect to its own maximal ideal $\mathfrak{m}_R$. Assume that the composite of the structure map $\mathcal{O} \to R$ with the residue map $R \to R/\mathfrak{m}_R$ is surjective, i.e. that $\mathcal{O}$ surjects onto the residue field of $R$. Let $r$ be a natural number and $a : \mathrm{Fin}\,r \to R$ a family of elements with $a_i \in \mathfrak{m}_R$ for every $i$, and suppose that $$\mathfrak{m}_R \subseteq (a_1,\dots,a_r) + \mathfrak{m}_R^2 + \mathfrak{m}_{\mathcal{O}}R,$$ where $(a_1,\dots,a_r)$ is the ideal generated by the range of $a$ and $\mathfrak{m}_{\mathcal{O}}R$ denotes the image ideal of $\mathfrak{m}_{\mathcal{O}}$ under the structure map. Then there exists an $\mathcal{O}$-algebra homomorphism $\psi : \mathcal{O}[[X_1,\dots,X_r]] \to R$ from the ring of multivariate formal power series in the variables indexed by $\mathrm{Fin}\,r$ such that $\psi(X_i) = a_i$ for every $i$ and $\psi$ is surjective.
--
--   This is the step passing from a bound on the number of generators of the relative cotangent space $\mathfrak{m}_R/(\mathfrak{m}_R^2 + \mathfrak{m}_{\mathcal{O}}R)$ to a presentation of $R$ as a quotient of a power series ring over $\mathcal{O}$ in exactly that many variables. It supplies the surjection $\psi$ used to present deformation rings and the rings occurring in patching arguments, and is cited in the construction of completions modelled on crossing (node) rings.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_IsLocalRing_exists_mvPowerSeries_algHom_apply_X_eq_and_surjective_of_span.lean

import Mathlib.RingTheory.MvPowerSeries.Inverse
import Mathlib.RingTheory.AdicCompletion.Noetherian

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency.types false

universe u v
open IsLocalRing

theorem IsLocalRing.exists_mvPowerSeries_algHom_apply_X_eq_and_surjective_of_span
    {𝒪 : Type u} {R : Type v} [CommRing 𝒪] [IsLocalRing 𝒪] [IsAdicComplete (maximalIdeal 𝒪) 𝒪]
    [CommRing R] [Algebra 𝒪 R] [IsLocalRing R] [IsNoetherianRing R] [IsAdicComplete (maximalIdeal R) R]
    (hres : Function.Surjective (⇑(residue R) ∘ ⇑(algebraMap 𝒪 R)))
    {r : ℕ} (a : Fin r → R) (ha : ∀ i, a i ∈ maximalIdeal R)
    (hgen : maximalIdeal R ≤
      Ideal.span (Set.range a) ⊔ maximalIdeal R ^ 2 ⊔ (maximalIdeal 𝒪).map (algebraMap 𝒪 R)) :
    ∃ ψ : MvPowerSeries (Fin r) 𝒪 →ₐ[𝒪] R, (∀ i, ψ (MvPowerSeries.X i) = a i) ∧ Function.Surjective ψ := by sorry
